00:37:04.230 --> 00:37:05.930
And that way, I can
go back and say,

00:37:05.930 --> 00:37:07.070
what was I doing back then?

00:37:07.070 --> 00:37:08.720
Because I might go
through some phase

00:37:08.720 --> 00:37:10.280
where I'm trying
to do more pull ups

00:37:10.280 --> 00:37:12.380
or I'm trying to deadlift
more and I'm trying--

00:37:12.380 --> 00:37:15.957
whatever the thing
is, I'll go back

00:37:15.957 --> 00:37:18.290
into-- because I get bored
