01:11:11.713 --> 01:11:13.380
The Linda Vista Boys
Club, everyone else

01:11:13.380 --> 01:11:14.670
left, I was left there alone.

01:11:14.670 --> 01:11:17.170
I was 14 because of my home
life at that time, et cetera,

01:11:17.170 --> 01:11:17.940
and he was like,
where are you going?

01:11:17.940 --> 01:11:19.470
I'm like, I'm going to
take the bus to Lancaster.

01:11:19.470 --> 01:11:19.950
I know this guy.

01:11:19.950 --> 01:11:22.185
And he was like, no, no,
you're coming to our house.

01:11:22.185 --> 01:11:22.810
I was like, OK.

01:11:22.810 --> 01:11:25.890
So he took me at Tony's house,
and I went into Tony's room

01:11:25.890 --> 01:11:26.940
that he had grown up in.

01:11:26.940 --> 01:11:28.770
Tony lived in
Fallbrook at that time.

01:11:28.770 --> 01:11:31.260
And the room wasn't
filled with trophies.

01:11:31.260 --> 01:11:33.690
The room was trophies
and I remember just

01:11:33.690 --> 01:11:36.150
thinking like, holy cow.

01:11:36.150 --> 01:11:37.528
And when I think
about that and I

01:11:37.528 --> 01:11:39.570
think about what a healthy
person Tony turned out

01:11:39.570 --> 01:11:41.070
to be because I
happened to be blessed

01:11:41.070 --> 01:11:42.720
to know him a little
bit, it's amazing

01:11:42.720 --> 01:11:44.370
because a lot of
people that had those

01:11:44.370 --> 01:11:46.920
trophies whatever
domain of life,

01:11:46.920 --> 01:11:49.793
they converted all that into
ways to just burn the oil down

01:11:49.793 --> 01:11:50.460
in their candle.

01:11:50.460 --> 01:11:52.920
He's a guy who's still
going in his 50s.

01:11:52.920 --> 01:11:55.710
So that's a little
side story, but I

01:11:55.710 --> 01:11:57.750
think this notion
of energy to me

01:11:57.750 --> 01:11:59.460
is so important
because, as you said,

01:11:59.460 --> 01:12:02.820
when we move toward action
and we complete something,

01:12:02.820 --> 01:12:05.490
the oil in that candle
starts to get replenished,

01:12:05.490 --> 01:12:07.680
and the flame burns hotter.

